  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing the illegal trade of threatened species of parrots in Paraguay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will increase effective conservation of globally threatened parrots through the reduction of illegal trade as a threat to their populations, and raise public awareness regarding their conservation needs. Specific objectives include: (1) Determine the volume, economics and geographic scale of trade in the target species and other threatened wildlife; (2) Build the capacity of law enforcement agents and strengthen existing enforcement measures; (3) Develop and implement outreach and education programs to discourage both demand and trade.</narrative>
  </description>
